{"2250500":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Rhythia","steam_appid":2250500,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Rhythia on Steam, compared to other open source alternatives and implementations, is a completely new and refreshed client that aims to bring online and community features. The goal is to develop and improve on the familiar gameplay concept. More information and links are available on the Rhythia portal.<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2250500\/extras\/a2aceab7839e013748b4833764af030c.avif?t=1786627361\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2250500\/extras_big\/a2aceab7839e013748b4833764af030c.webp?t=1786627361 width=1560 height=199 \/><\/span><strong><\/strong><br>  <br><strong>Rhythia<\/strong> is a game in which you aim and hit musical beats with precision. You will be targeting blocks, mastering timing, building combos, perfecting your accuracy and climbing leaderboards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beginning you will find yourself learning the 3x3 grid layout, aiming at individual blocks and building basic combos by hand, but in short time you can become a rhythm master, with flawless accuracy, perfect timing and seamless aim transitions, all for those satisfying perfect scores. This intense focus on precision and timing rewards dedicated practice, so you will need to develop your aim and musical reflexes to achieve mastery.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2250500\/extras\/2b07fe6dabbe6a06b7db8af05cb334a7.avif?t=1786627361\" data-big-src=