wards dedicated practice, so you will need to develop your aim and musical reflexes to achieve mastery.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2250500\/extras\/2b07fe6dabbe6a06b7db8af05cb334a7.avif?t=1786627361\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2250500\/extras_big\/2b07fe6dabbe6a06b7db8af05cb334a7.webp?t=1786627361 width=1560 height=443 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythia<\/strong> offers players unlimited customization of the game - to the smallest detail of gameplay, game interface and elements. It comes bundled with existing shapes, models and presets for you to choose from, and build your own experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Rhythia is a game about aiming and hitting musical beats with precision timing, within a dynamic 3x3 grid system. Use your reflexes to target flying blocks, combine accurate aim with perfect rhythm, and finally master the leaderboards against players who challenge your precision skills.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2250500\/7466f597a3eb3bad16b0180be3deef182d222690\/header.jpg?t=1786627361","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2250500\/bc5c499692e9f7c406fcb7bbcfb77a77348eef16\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786627361","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2250500\/bc5c499692e9f7c406fcb7bbcfb77a77348eef16\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786627361","website":"https:\/\/rhythia.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><stro